   "source": [
    "# 5============================================================\n",
    "# ✅ FULL FIXED Kaggle Code (Block-consistent + TRUE Group-safe tuning + Leak-safe calibration)\n",
    "# ------------------------------------------------------------\n",
    "# Fixes (vs your current run):\n",
